        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart LR\n  Citizen([\&quot;Citizen / Property Owner\&quot;]) --&gt; Browser([\&quot;Web Browser\&quot;])\n  Browser --&gt; UI\n\n  subgraph UI[\&quot;PRESENTATION LAYER&lt;br/&gt;HTML5 + CSS3 + Vanilla JavaScript\&quot;]\n    direction TB\n    Login[\&quot;Login\&quot;] --&gt; Dashboard[\&quot;Dashboard\&quot;]\n    Dashboard --&gt; Search[\&quot;Property Search\&quot;]\n    Search --&gt; Details[\&quot;Property Details\&quot;]\n    Details --&gt; Assessment[\&quot;Self-Assessment\&quot;]\n    Assessment --&gt; Calculator[\&quot;Tax Calculator\&quot;]\n    Calculator --&gt; Payment[\&quot;Payment\&quot;]\n    Payment --&gt; Success[\&quot;Payment Success\&quot;]\n    Success --&gt; Receipt[\&quot;Receipt\&quot;]\n    Receipt --&gt; History[\&quot;Payment History\&quot;]\n    Details --&gt; Issue[\&quot;Property / Tax Issue\&quot;]\n    Issue --&gt; Objection[\&quot;Submit Objection\&quot;]\n    Objection --&gt; Track[\&quot;Track Objection\&quot;]\n    Dashboard --&gt; Profile[\&quot;Profile\&quot;]\n    Dashboard --&gt; Help[\&quot;Help &amp; Support\&quot;]\n  end\n\n  UI --&gt; Logic\n\n  subgraph Logic[\&quot;APPLICATION LOGIC LAYER\&quot;]\n    direction TB\n    Auth[\&quot;Authentication\&quot;]\n    SearchLogic[\&quot;Property Search\&quot;]\n    Validation[\&quot;Self-Assessment Validation\&quot;]\n    TaxCalc[\&quot;Tax Calculation\&quot;]\n    PaySim[\&quot;Payment Simulation\&quot;]\n    ReceiptGen[\&quot;Receipt Generation\&quot;]\n    HistoryLogic[\&quot;Payment History\&quot;]\n    ObjectionLogic[\&quot;Objection Handling\&quot;]\n    ProfileLogic[\&quot;Profile Management\&quot;]\n    FormValidation[\&quot;Form Validation\&quot;]\n    Auth --&gt; SearchLogic\n    SearchLogic --&gt; Validation\n    Validation --&gt; TaxCalc\n    TaxCalc --&gt; PaySim\n    PaySim --&gt; ReceiptGen\n    ReceiptGen --&gt; HistoryLogic\n    ObjectionLogic --&gt; HistoryLogic\n    ProfileLogic --